criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
(Suspected) post-acute infection syndrome (e.g., PCS, ME/CFS, post-VAC);
Duration of illness of at least 6 months;
Functional limitations with a PCFS score ≥ 3;
Residence in Baden-Württemberg or a district bordering BW;
Capacity to consent and consent to participate in the study;
Insurance under statutory health insurance;
Exclusion criteria:
Inability to visit a SPVP OR attend a video consultation;
